WEBVTT

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:03.970
Senka-ryu
Traditional

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:03.970
Japanese Dance

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.970
Senka-ryu

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.970
Traditional
Japanese Dance

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.970
Hanayagi

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.660
Kaoruko! KAORUKO!

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:08.950
Miss Kaoruko?!

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.410
Isurugi! Have you seen her?

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.040
No, I can't find her anywhere.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.950
That girl ran away again?!

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.040
Fantastic kimono girl!

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.200
How cute! She's just like a doll!

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.290
She's so pretty!

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:30.160
Isn't she wonderful?

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.160
So nice and lovely!

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.950
Thank you so much!

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:38.250
"Thank you so much," my foot.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.540
Futaba...

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.660
I'm tired of all this.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:52.500
Every day, it's "Practice, practice, practice!"

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.620
I mean, even flowers need some love, right?

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:01.580
If they don't bathe in the sun and
drink lots of yummy water...

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.910
they can't bloom and become beautiful!

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:08.200
But you've gotta carry on the family tradition, right?

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:13.830
I've made up my mind! I will marry into a different family,
one that gives me more attention!

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.870
Do you have money for the train?

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:19.790
Huh?

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:22.750
I-I have about 50 yen.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.330
Do you know HOW to ride the train?

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:27.410
Hey, I'm not an idiot!

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:28.790
Then you'll be fine.

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:32.540
I'll let your aunt and the headmaster know.

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.450
Huh? Wait!

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:39.500
What a shame. I sure did like the way you dance...

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:41.830
Huh?

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:47.500
I see. So, you'll be gone for good, huh? That's too bad...

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:52.370
W-well, after all that, I guess I don't have
much of a choice. I'll go back.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:54.370
And when I do...

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:59.000
you'll have to buy me snacks and
say how awesome I am, okay?

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:01.870
After all, you're my number one fan.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:03.200
What?!

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:09.040
In return, you'll be the first person in the world
to see just how bright I can shine!

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:12.200
The fare for this taxi is 50 yen.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.370
Wh-what a ripoff!

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:19.000
Ow, ow, ow, ow! That hurts! Ow! And, like, ow!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:23.250
I guess I don't have much of a choice.
I'll have to stick around, for Kaoruko's sake...

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:31.500
I'm gonna have to... put you back in your place!

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:43.350
Revue Starlight

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:52.120
Ano hoshi o tsukamu no wa daare?
Who, oh who, will be the one to grab hold of the star?

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:59.080
Tou no choujou de
At the very top of that tower

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:13.500
Shizuka ni tomotta honou ga atsuku mune o kogashite iku
These flames lit in silence fill my chest with a white-hot passion

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:15.750
Unmei no wa
That's just the Wheel of Fortune

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:23.410
Butai no ue de odorasareteiru wake ja nai
It's not like I'm being forced to dance on this stage

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.620
Tobitate
Spring forth

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.500
Tashika ni ano hi mitanda
I'm sure I saw it that day

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:33.120
Hajiketa hoshi no kirameki
The brilliance of a star that has burst open

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:39.580
Iroaseta yakusoku ni yubi ga fureru made
Until my fingers reach out to touch that faded promise

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:43.660
Makuake mae ni hajimaru
It will start before the curtain rises

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.200
Me no mae de tsuzurareteku
And be spelled out before our eyes

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:50.830
Umarekawatta watashi wa
Having been reborn

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:54.660
Koko de kimi ni aeta
I was able to meet you here

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.290
Mou ichido
Once again

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:06.200
Are we good, Hikari-chan?

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:10.870
Be sure to fold your shirts and towels,
and then put them in these drawers, okay?

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:12.700
But I'll just use them again-

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:13.410
No, no!

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:14.790
You need to keep things clean!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.200
Hikari-chan's actually listening?!

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.290
Mahiru-chan, you're like a big sister!

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.870
Because I AM a big sister.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.080
Hey, we're here. Wake up!

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:33.250
Good morning!

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.500
Futaba-chan, Kaoruko-chan!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.410
Hey. 'Morning.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.000
And... off!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.910
You ripped off my eyebrows!

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:46.370
Can't you be more gentle when you wake me up?

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:48.450
Why don't you wake YOURSELF up already?

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:49.750
Good morning, everyone.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:52.790
You two have been coming to school early lately, huh?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.950
I wish she'd let me sleep in a bit later though...

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.910
Well, there's no way we're going to lose
to some sleepyhead, you know?

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.950
Yeah, you've got that right!

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.620
Karen-chan, she means YOU.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:17.660
Okay, that's enough!

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:20.580
Don't forget to double-check your partner's steps.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:24.120
When did Futaba get so good?

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.580
Always struggling at the mercy of fate, huh?

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:30.330
Neither of them can drop their guard.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:32.540
What?

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.830
Futaba, about that tap dancing earlier...

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:40.620
Hm?

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.410
All right, pay attention!

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.910
Hi there. I'm Masai, the stage director from Group B.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:47.700
I'm Amemiya, the scriptwriter.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.540
And I'm Daiba, the junior scriptwriter!

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:56.580
Um, we'll soon start main production work
on the 100th Seisho Festival.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:06:01.580
This will be the second time for us
in the 99th class to do "Starlight,"

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:05.790
100th Seisho Festival
Main Cast Auditions
Drama STARLIGHT
Director = Kiriko Masai
Script = Shion Amemiya
(Undecided)
Flora
Claire

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:05.790
(Undecided)

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:05.790
(Undecided)

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:05.830
so we will again be holding auditions
for the eight lead roles.

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:10.290
Doing the same performance would just be boring,
so we'd like to explore some different approaches...

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:13.200
Which is why we'll be allowing multiple auditions.

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:16.080
So, don't give up after your first try, okay?

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:17.830
Hang in there and keep on performing!

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:24.410
First Round
Main Cast Selections
#18 Maya Tendo
#11 Claudine Saijo
#29 Hikari Kagura
#9 Masako Kenzaki

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.750
I'm not... My name's not on there!

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:28.060
#15 Nana Daiba
#17 Mahiru Tsuyuzaki
#25 Junna Hoshimi
#19 Akira Nakamura

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:28.060
#2 Futaba Isurugi
#1 Karen Aijo

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.060
End

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:32.450
Banana said we shouldn't give up after just one try, right?

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:33.830
So-

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.250
Hey, Kaoruko!

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:42.200
Stage Production
Department

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:41.910
This is the first time I've lost out on a lead role,
on any production!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:47.410
So, if I'm not playing a lead, just what am I doing?!

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:49.580
Well, the thing is...

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:51.040
I'm going to be blunt.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.660
In this next "Starlight," there's no place for you at all.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.540
Your acting lacks passion and, frankly, it rings hollow.

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:00.870
You may be next in line for
your traditional dance or whatever,

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:04.000
but frankly, you don't have
what it takes to be on our stage.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:09.500
I'm the one who turns them down! That's how it goes!

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:14.700
You've got to be kidding me! This is infuriating!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.870
Who do they think they are?! Jeez!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:25.500
If I don't get a part in the show,
then just give me yours, okay?

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:41.260
Scented

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:40.290
What a nice bath.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.080
Futaba, will you massage my fee...?

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.660
That's it for today.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.370
Thank you... Yeah, thanks.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.830
You've gotten rather good, haven't you, Futaba?

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.000
I sure hope so.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:12.700
Well... Is this some special training
you've been hiding from me?

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.200
Kaoruko!

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.450
Claudine as your instructor, huh?

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.660
No wonder it seemed like you'd suddenly improved...

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.830
I wanted to get better, much better!

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:28.700
So you stole the part of the goddess, didn't you?
That role was MINE!

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.290
Kaoruko, hold on!

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:34.830
You know what? You don't understand a thing.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.700
It's like that girl from Group B said...
you don't have what it takes!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.000
Wh-what was that?!

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.790
I earned this part, and there's no way I'm giving it up.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.120
Y-you backstabber!

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:52.250
If Claudine is so perfect, then
why don't you go be with her instead?!

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.620
Yeah, I'll do that!

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.870
As of today, I'm staying here!

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:02.250
What?!

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.250
Yeah, like I care!

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.160
I... I can't do it.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.580
Kaoruko-chan?

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.250
We're still at the entrance.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.500
Ow, ow, ow...

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:47.510
Scented

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:53.330
I swear... My feet are so swollen.
This is all Futaba's fault!

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:56.540
Just you wait.
One day, you're not gonna know what hit you!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.540
Oh, yeah. The giraffe's audition!

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:05.580
I'm the lead role on the stage of fate...

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.660
I'll beat everyone, then grab the title of Top Star...

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.120
and become the best in the world!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.120
M..Mahiru-chan! S-stop this!

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:16.120
Hey!

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:16.700
Gotcha!

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.080
Oh my, what a shame!

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.700
I really can't drop my guard, can I?

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.580
Up here on the stage, we should fight with honor!

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:45.870
Wh-what should I do? I'm pretty much done for...

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.500
Futaba!

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.040
Scented

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:57.620
That's it...

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:02.500
Kaoruko-chan!

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:05.910
What is all this? You can't really be quitting, right?!

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:10.330
I was just thinking,
there's nothing left for me to learn here...

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:07.700
Right?!

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.910
so I decided to go back to Kyoto and
head up our Senka-ryu school.

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:16.370
But why? Why?!

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:19.660
Can't you do that after you've graduated?

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.160
We've all worked so hard to get this far...

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:25.410
Kaoruko-chan, I don't want you to just quit!

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.950
And what does Futaba-chan think about this?

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:33.330
F-Futaba's got nothing to do with it.

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:36.700
This is my decision! It's mine, all mine!

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.830
Are you serious?

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:46.660
It's no use trying to stop me.

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:49.910
You're really going to leave
after losing one single audition?

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.500
Excuse me? I'm not sure I know what you mean by that.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:56.830
Futaba, you just stay here and
keep an eye on things, okay?

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:59.120
Oh, and I hope you and
your new friend Claudine get even closer.

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.660
Do you even have money for the train?

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:04.500
That's not for you to worry about.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.910
Do you know how to take the bullet train?

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.370
I do. Don't bother seeing me off.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:11.410
Well then, I guess you're all set.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:13.540
What?

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:21.000
I guess Kaoruko really meant it...

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:23.910
Well, this is a good chance.

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:24.700
Huh?

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:27.200
Seeing as how Kaoruko just doesn't get it...

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:32.410
This place is serious. If you're just along
for the ride, you don't belong here.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:37.700
Also, Futaba, you got a lead role
because you have talent.

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:40.330
You can do this on your own.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.160
Seisho Music Academy?

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:51.580
It's a school of the arts. I can study traditional dance
there, as well as other styles.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:56.410
I think I can hone my skills there
and become the best in the world!

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:58.040
Huh...

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:01.200
That means you're coming too, Futaba.

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:02.950
What?!

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:07.080
Taxi fare is 500 yen.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.580
It's gotten more expensive?!

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:18.200
Kaoruko-chan!

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.200
You can't go!

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:24.200
I'm sorry, but I've bought my ticket and I'm leaving.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:24.200
No... Don't go!

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:30.660
I'll be on the bullet train a little past 12:00.
Come this afternoon, I'll be saying goodbye to Tokyo

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:35.250
Since it's my last day,
maybe I can do a bit more sightseeing...

00:13:33.070 --> 00:13:35.330
Claudine Saijo
Futaba Isurugi

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.250
You think?

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.950
Tendo?

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.160
You will be sad.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:51.120
I've felt the same as you, Hanayagi-san.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:57.370
You feel a sense of responsibility. For the people
who follow you, for those who support you...

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:01.330
You want to be the best that you can be.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.580
Take care once you're back in Kyoto.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.330
Okay... Well, goodbye.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.870
Kaoruko-chan!

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:27.950
They're going to regret it when I'm gone!

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:29.580
Still...

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:35.040
You feel a sense of responsibility. For the people
who follow you, for those who support you...

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:38.830
You want to be the best that you can be.

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:47.830
The people who follow me...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.660
Does that mean... Futaba?

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.790
But she... ain't following me at all.

