Nozomi 1349 14:13 Shin-Osaka

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.580
Non-Reserved Seats Cars 1-7, 13-15

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.120
Thank you for using the bullet train.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:15.250
The train currently on Track Number 19, the Nozomi 1341,

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:20.040
will depart at 12:13 pm, headed for Shin-Osaka.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:20.870
But why...?

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:24.330
The first and second cabins are...

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.620
Is she seriously okay with me just leaving?!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:31.120
Why isn't she coming after me?!

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:38.410
You're the one who said you wanted to quit, right?

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:44.040
Wh-what are you even doing here?

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:48.290
I figured you'd be crying by now,
thinking you'd gone too far to turn back.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:50.870
What? Are you stupid?!

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:55.200
Aren't you just scared you'll be lost if I'm not around?

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:58.160
I'm not the one who'll be lost on her own, you know!

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.660
You weren't even really going to leave, were you?!

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.500
I know you're just dragging things out
and making a big show of it.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.790
Well then, how come you're all out of breath from
chasing me here?!

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:10.000
It's obvious that you came here to stop me!

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:12.410
Kaoruko, you're so stubborn!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.080
Well, you're just a backstabber!

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.160
And you're cold-hearted!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:17.580
And a dummy!

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:22.540
Audition
Day 5

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:34.330
There is a path we two have walked,
one that goes between song and dance...

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:40.580
Yet I have found a straight path,
one that rises to the night sky!

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:44.080
Student of the 99th class, Futaba Isurugi!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.330
I will dash forth with fighting spirit!

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:50.000
Student of the 99th class, Kaoruko Hanayagi!

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:52.450
I'll have you follow me till the very end!

00:16:57.080 --> 00:17:02.410
The fifth day of auditions,
the "Revue of Promise," will now commence.

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:09.580
Let us compete in song and dance,
and aim to become the Top Star.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:14.870
If I win... you'll be the one who takes care of me!

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:20.000
You'll buy me sweets, massage my feet,
and bring me to school by motorcycle!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.830
Huh? Why would I have to-?

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:25.330
Those are all things you make me do, right?!

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:29.200
Then if I win, we're going back to Kyoto together!

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:31.620
If you think you can beat me, go ahead and try!

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.750
These auditions have become increasingly personal...

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.000
I understand.

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.750
Kaoruko, that attitude of yours...

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:42.120
is gonna need some adjustment!

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:50.330
Pinkies of children entwined, a promise to always be together

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:57.950
How many days, I wonder, have passed since then?

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:05.330
I look up, and those petals I saw were so very blinding

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.370
Kaoruko!

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:03.040
Do you remember my rank when
I passed the entrance exam?

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:03.950
What?!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:08.620
Out of those 30 candidates...
I was the thirtieth! I was dead last!

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:12.660
I felt as though even if I reached for you, I would fall short

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.450
S-so what?!

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:14.950
I got into this school because
I trained till my fingers bled!

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:17.660
If you want to go down separate paths

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:18.950
And I only got my motorcycle license because
you said it's too hard for you to walk here!

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:20.580
I won't stop you

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.370
You always ran away, so I always searched for you!

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:25.000
If there is no happiness here

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.450
You made me a promise, right?

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.160
You can go bloom somewhere else

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:31.080
You said I'd be the first one in the world to see it,
the part of you that shines the brightest!

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:41.120
I want more than anything to see that moment you're in full bloom

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:32.620
That's why...

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:35.620
I've followed you this whole time!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.000
Futaba. You...

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:49.580
It's like Karen said, right?
A Stage Girl gets better, day by day.

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:55.580
That's why even when Tendo and Claudine
get the lead roles, she keeps pushing forward!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:02.370
Everyone is the same:
they want to shine that much brighter!

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:04.250
And even me, I...

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.790
I don't want to stick around just being some fan!

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.290
I want to be the one closest to you,
so we can see that shine, together!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:14.620
I believed, without a doubt, you would always protect me

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:11.870
Kaoruko!

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:14.790
Futaba...

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:21.950
This caged bird has forever yearned for the blue skies

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:20.830
You made... that flower bloom, didn't you?

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:23.910
It's such a big, beautiful flower.

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:29.500
When did this young bird find its voice?

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.250
Compared to that, I...

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:37.290
Flowers and wings alike ride gently upon the breeze

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.330
Hey...!

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:36.540
It took me too long to understand what Tendo meant...

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:41.910
Farewell, I'm leaving on my journey

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.620
You're in the main cast, Futaba.

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:42.620
It suits you more than it does me!

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:44.790
This instant, away from you

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:49.200
So memories will not be forgotten

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:48.120
Stop it!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.330
I'm going to hollow out my heart and leave

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:55.950
Oh, my. Was that too shallow?

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:00.750
About time. You finally stopped me!

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:03.500
Wh-what?!

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:06.500
Thank you, Futaba!

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:18.220
Revue of Promise
A Song or
the Blooming of Flowers?

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:18.080
For those who follow me...

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:22.200
The swift stream of a river, though divided by a rock

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:21.250
For those who support me...

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:25.580
I must keep going, being the best that I can be, right?

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:25.080
Will eventually reunite

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:29.540
Paths that go separate ways also

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:27.620
Kaoruko...

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.870
Will at length become one

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:48.580
Make the flower bloom, for the sake of one person,
and live life to the fullest

00:20:56.500 --> 00:21:00.660
This concludes the fifth day of auditions.

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.660
You can do it if you try, huh?

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:10.830
Look at that... I'm a Stage Girl!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:14.080
I will make another flower bloom...

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:16.370
And then you'll see!

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:32.080
Whoa!

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:41.310
Yum
Thank you!
Futaba

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:47.440
