With Gratitude
Kaoruko Hanayagi
Kyoto Snacks

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:49.540
I will not give in

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:01.120
Futaba! We've got to become the best in the world!

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.910
Once that happens, I'll pay you back for the taxi fare!

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:07.040
Well, I guess I've got no choice!

